## Context

Tracker 0406, step S3. After S2, `experiments/analysis.mk` (186 l) is
P2-only and `experiments/render.mk` holds P3. But `experiments/Makefile`
(330 l) still mixes P1 sweeps with P2 scoring verbs AND several P3
render rules. S3 consolidates all P2 into
`experiments/derived/score.mk` (the .mk lives with its deliverables) and
moves the P3 strays to render.mk, leaving experiments/Makefile pure P1
for S4.

Classification of experiments/Makefile content (verified 2026-06-04;
re-anchor on target names, not line numbers):

| Target/rule | Phase | Destination |
|-------------|-------|-------------|
| census/regimes/decomposed/verification/sourced/frontier sweeps (l.~53-127) | P1 | stays (S4 renames file) |
| `extract` (l.145) | P2 | score.mk |
| `outputs/%.record.json`, `derived/%.record.json` pattern rules + .PRECIOUS | P2 | score.mk |
| `../measurements.jsonl` rule | P2 | score.mk |
| `evaluate-all-records`, `rebuild-measurements` | P2 | score.mk |
| `$(SC_JSON)` (self_consistency scorer: outputs/rag → derived/rag_consistency) | P2 | score.mk |
| `$(SC_TEX) $(SC_PERRUN)` grouped rule + `self-consistency` verb (tabulate → report/inputs/generated/) | P3 | render.mk |
| `exp1-cost-summary` + `$(EXP1_COST_TEX)` | P3 | render.mk |
| `exp1-reasoning-topup` + `$(EXP1_TOPUP_TEX)` | P3 | render.mk |
| pdf2md/build-corpus/preflight/help, Zotero/corpus config | P1 utils | stays |

Plus: ALL of analysis.mk (extraction stamps, cross-eval CSV, mart rule,
dual-run parity staging) → score.mk; analysis.mk is then deleted and
every reference to it repointed.

## Design constraints (ratified, tracker 0406)

- score.mk lives at `experiments/derived/score.mk`. Sources:
  `experiments/outputs/**` (NO rules for them — that is P1's outcome).
  Outcomes: `measurements.jsonl` (mart v0 — do NOT move/rename it),
  `exp2_mart.jsonl`, cross-eval CSVs.
- Header contract: opening comment with phase (P2 score), sources,
  outcomes, invariant "no rules for upstream (P1) outcomes"; scripts
  newly invoked from score.mk get a phase line in their module
  docstring (extract, evaluate/assemble CLI, build_exp2_mart,
  self_consistency, ...). Many already carry one from S2 — only add
  where missing, and fix any now-wrong P3 label on scripts that
  turn out to be P2 (self_consistency.py if S2 labeled it).
- `rebuild-measurements` keeps working and its recipe comment documents
  the deliberate-and-reviewed protocol (0383 lesson: destroys all
  .record.json; output reviewed via git diff before commit).
- **Path discipline**: the moved verbs use cwd-relative paths
  (`outputs/...`, `../measurements.jsonl`) that assume
  cwd=experiments/. Anchor score.mk's paths via the shared
  `experiments/paths.mk` variables (extend it if needed) so
  `make -f experiments/derived/score.mk <verb>` works from repo root;
  use $(CURDIR)-anchored or paths.mk-derived absolutes, not fragile
  relatives.
- Guard test: `tests/test_score_build_no_acquire.py`
  (@pytest.mark.adherence) — dry-run trace of score.mk verbs contains
  no worker/query/sweep invocations (worker, query_, run_sweep,
  aedist.census etc. — derive the needle list from acquire-side
  scripts) and no TARGET under `experiments/outputs/`.
  CAUTION with -n on .PHONY verbs that wrap $(MAKE): recursive make
  still executes the inner make with -n propagated — acceptable; but
  never run the verbs for real (0383 mart staleness).

## Relevant files

- `experiments/analysis.mk` — dissolves into score.mk (delete after)
- `experiments/Makefile` — P2 verbs + P3 strays leave; P1 stays
- `experiments/render.mk` — receives the three P3 stray rule groups
- `experiments/paths.mk` — gains any vars score.mk needs shared
- root `Makefile` — repoint any `-f experiments/analysis.mk` /
  `-C experiments <P2 verb>` delegations to score.mk
- `.github/workflows/` + `tests/` — sweep for analysis.mk references
  (test_makefile_dag.py, clean-room tests mention it post-S2)
- `docs/pipeline-phases.md` — P2 section gains score.mk; note
  analysis.mk is gone

## Actions

1. Red test first (the guard test above; red while score.mk absent).
2. Create score.mk (header contract; analysis.mk content + P2 verbs
   from experiments/Makefile, paths anchored).
3. Move the three P3 stray groups into render.mk (keep recipes
   verbatim; only path-var adjustments).
4. Delete analysis.mk; sweep and repoint every reference (grep -rn
   "analysis.mk" --exclude-dir=.git).
5. Docstring phase lines where missing/wrong.
6. Update docs/pipeline-phases.md.

## Test

The guard test of action 1. Existing gates that must stay green:
test_render_build_clean_room, test_makefile_dag, both P4 clean-room
tests, test_no_tracked_ignored_files.

## Verification

- [ ] `grep -rn "analysis.mk" --exclude-dir=.git .` → only historical
      mentions in docs/tickets, zero in Makefiles/tests/CI
- [ ] score.mk dry-run verbs work from repo root; no outputs/ targets,
      no acquire invocations (guard test)
- [ ] experiments/Makefile contains zero rules writing outside
      experiments/ (pure P1 + utils, ready for S4)
- [ ] `make check` green; `make report` / `make slides` build
- [ ] CI green

## Invariants

- No artifact content changes; NEVER run P2 targets for real — dry-run
  only (0383)
- `measurements.jsonl` path and name unchanged (mart v0 until 0297)
- One PR, this child only; tracker 0406 stays open

## Exit criteria

- score.mk exists (header contract, anchored paths); analysis.mk gone
- experiments/Makefile is P1+utils only — zero P2/P3 rules
- render.mk owns the three former strays; all guards green
